<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>EduSmart - Kursus Online Modern</title>
  
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-light: #f5f7fa;
      --text-main: #111827;
      --text-muted: #6b7280;
      --accent: #2563eb;
      --dark-card: #0f172a;
      
      --container-bg: #ffffff;
      --navbar-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
      --navbar-scrolled: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
      --stats-bg: #f8fafc;
      --overlay-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
      --btn-text: #ffffff;
      --btn-hover: #374151;
      --border-color: #e5e7eb;
    }

    body.dark-theme {
      --bg-light: #0f172a;
      --text-main: #f8fafc;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --dark-card: #1e293b;
      
      --container-bg: #0f172a;
      --navbar-bg: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
      --navbar-scrolled: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95);
      --stats-bg: #1e293b;
      --overlay-bg: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
      --btn-text: #0f172a;
      --btn-hover: #cbd5e1;
      --border-color: #334155;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618005182384-a83a8bd57fbe?q=80&w=2564') no-repeat center center fixed;
      background-size: cover;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--text-main);
      min-height: 100vh;
      transition: color 0.4s ease;
    }

    .bg-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
      background: var(--overlay-bg);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      z-index: -1;
      transition: background 0.4s ease;
    }

    .main-container {
      background: var(--container-bg);
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1200px;
      border-radius: 40px;
      padding: 40px 50px;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      transition: background 0.4s ease;
    }

    /* ANIMATIONS */
    .reveal {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(40px);
      transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
    }
    .reveal.active {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
    .delay-1 { transition-delay: 0.1s; }
    .delay-2 { transition-delay: 0.2s; }
    .delay-3 { transition-delay: 0.3s; }
    .delay-4 { transition-delay: 0.4s; }

    /* NAVBAR */
    .navbar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      position: sticky;
      top: 20px;
      z-index: 1000;
      background: var(--navbar-bg);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      padding: 15px 30px;
      border-radius: 40px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
    }

    .navbar.scrolled {
      background: var(--navbar-scrolled);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      padding: 12px 30px;
      border-color: transparent;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 15px;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .nav-links li a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      position: relative;
    }

    .nav-links li a::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 2px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 0;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--text-main);
      transition: width 0.3s ease;
    }

    .nav-links li a:hover::after, .nav-links li a.active::after {
      width: 60%;
    }

    .nav-links li a:hover, .nav-links li a.active {
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .btn-book {
      background: var(--text-main);
      color: var(--btn-text);
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
    }

    .btn-book:hover {
      background: var(--btn-text);
      color: var(--text-main);
      border-color: var(--text-main);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    /* HERO */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      height: 480px;
      border-radius: 32px;
      background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522202176988-66273c2fd55f?q=80&w=1200') no-repeat center center;
      background-size: cover;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      color: white;
      padding: 40px;
      overflow: hidden;
      animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.98); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin-top: -30px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 42px;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      opacity: 0.9;
      max-width: 450px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--text-main);
      color: var(--btn-text);
      padding: 12px 28px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 13px;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-block;
      transition: 0.3s;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: var(--btn-hover);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    .hero-footer {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 25px;
      left: 30px;
      right: 30px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
      z-index: 2;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .hero-avatars {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      text-align: left;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    
    .hero-avatars p {
      margin: 0;
      opacity: 0.9;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .avatars-group {
      display: flex;
    }

    .avatars-group img {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 2px solid #fff;
      margin-left: -10px;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.3s;
    }
    .avatars-group img:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.1);
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .avatars-group img:first-child {
      margin-left: 0;
    }

    .hero-socials {
      display: flex;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .hero-socials a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      font-weight: 300;
      transition: opacity 0.3s;
    }
    .hero-socials a:hover {
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    /* ABOUT SECTION */
    .about-section {
      display: flex;
      gap: 60px;
      margin: 50px 0;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .section-tag {
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text-main);
      white-space: nowrap;
      transition: border-color 0.4s ease;
    }

    .about-text {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    /* FEATURES GRID */
    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 30px;
      height: 320px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      transition: transform 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;
    }
    .feature-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .dark-card {
      background: var(--dark-card);
      color: white;
      justify-content: space-between;
      position: relative;
    }
    
    .dark-card .icon-top {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .dark-card h3 {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .dark-card h3 span {
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    .game-mode-toggle {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      width: fit-content;
    }

    .toggle-icon {
      width: 44px; height: 24px;
      background: #38bdf8;
      border-radius: 20px;
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0 4px;
      transition: background 0.3s;
    }

    .toggle-icon::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      width: 16px; height: 16px;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 50%;
      right: 4px;
    }
    .toggle-icon::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      width: 8px; height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 2px solid white;
      left: 6px;
    }

    .img-card {
      background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531482615713-2afd69097998?q=80&w=600') no-repeat center;
      background-size: cover;
      position: relative;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .img-card .glass-tag {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      padding: 8px 20px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      color: white;
      font-size: 13px;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .stats-card {
      background: var(--stats-bg);
      justify-content: space-between;
      transition: background 0.4s ease;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    }

    .stats-card h2 {
      font-size: 46px;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-bottom: 0px;
    }

    .stats-card p {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .stat-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .stat-dots {
      display: flex;
      gap: 5px;
    }

    .dot {
      width: 8px; height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #38bdf8;
    }

    .dot.inactive {
      background: #bae6fd;
    }

    .arrow-btn {
      width: 28px; height: 28px;
      background: var(--text-main);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      color: var(--btn-text);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      transition: transform 0.3s;
    }
    .arrow-btn:hover {
      transform: scale(1.1);
    }

    /* COURSES SECTION */
    .courses-section {
      margin-bottom: 70px;
    }
    .courses-title {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--accent);
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      transition: color 0.4s ease;
    }
    body.dark-theme .courses-title {
      color: #60a5fa;
    }
    .courses-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 25px;
    }
    .course-card {
      background: var(--stats-bg);
      border-radius: 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      transition: all 0.4s ease;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .course-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }
    .course-img {
      height: 200px;
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      transition: transform 0.6s ease;
    }
    .course-card:hover .course-img {
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }
    .course-content {
      padding: 25px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      flex: 1;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      background: inherit;
    }
    .course-content h3 {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      transition: color 0.4s ease;
    }
    body.dark-theme .course-content h3 {
      color: #60a5fa;
    }
    .course-content p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--text-main);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      font-weight: 300;
      flex: 1;
    }
    .course-price {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #10b981;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      transition: color 0.4s ease;
    }
    body.dark-theme .course-price {
      color: #34d399;
    }

    .btn-block {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      display: block;
    }

    /* NUMBERS SECTION */
    .numbers-section {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 70px;
    }

    .numbers-section h3 {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .numbers-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .number-item h2 {
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      color: var(--accent);
    }
    body.dark-theme .number-item h2 {
      color: #60a5fa;
    }

    .number-item p {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* SERVICES SECTION */
    .services-section {
      display: flex;
      gap: 40px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .services-info {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .services-info p {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin: 20px 0 30px;
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .btn-outline {
      background: var(--text-main);
      color: var(--btn-text);
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 12px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .btn-outline:hover {
      background: var(--btn-hover);
      transform: translateX(5px);
    }

    .services-cards {
      flex: 1.8;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .service-card {
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 20px;
      height: 220px;
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      color: white;
      transition: transform 0.4s ease;
    }
    .service-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
    }
    
    .card-1 {
      background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516321318423-f06f85e504b3?q=80&w=600');
    }
    .card-2 {
      background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573164713988-8665fc963095?q=80&w=600');
    }

    .service-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.1), rgba(0,0,0,0.6));
      border-radius: 24px;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .service-card > * {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .service-card .tag {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
      backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      font-size: 11px;
      width: fit-content;
    }

    .service-card .bottom-content {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
    }

    .service-card p {
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      max-width: 80%;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    /* RESPONSIVE */
    @media(max-width: 992px) {
      .features-grid, .courses-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .services-section {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      .about-section {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 20px;
      }
      .numbers-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }
    }
    
    @media(max-width: 768px) {
      .navbar {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 15px;
      }
      .services-cards {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .main-container {
        padding: 30px 20px;
      }
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 32px;
      }
      .hero-footer {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 15px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="bg-overlay"></div>

  <div class="main-container">
    
    <!-- NAVBAR -->
    <nav class="navbar" id="navbar">
      <div class="logo">EduSmart</div>
      
      <ul class="nav-links">
        <li><a href="#" class="active">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="#courses">Kursus</a></li>
        <li><a href="#">Kontak</a></li>
        <li><a href="dashboard.html">Dashboard</a></li>
      </ul>
      
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;">
        <a href="#" id="darkModeToggle" title="Toggle Theme" style="color: var(--text-main); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: color 0.3s; padding: 8px;" onmouseover="this.style.color='var(--accent)'" onmouseout="this.style.color='var(--text-main)'">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="login.html" title="Login" style="color: var(--text-main); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: color 0.3s; padding: 8px; margin-right: 10px;" onmouseover="this.style.color='var(--accent)'" onmouseout="this.style.color='var(--text-main)'">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
            <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="btn-book">Beranda Awal</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <header class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>Wujudkan Potensi Terbaikmu Hari Ini.<br>Semua Dalam Satu Platform.</h1>
        <p>Bergabunglah dengan platform kursus modern — tingkatkan skill digital dan wujudkan mimpimu menuju kesuksesan.</p>
        <button class="btn-primary" onclick="scrollToFeatures()">Mulai Belajar Sekarang</button>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-footer">
        <div class="hero-avatars">
          <div>
            <p>Belajar dengan mentor profesional.</p>
            <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);">Dapatkan hasil nyata.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="avatars-group">
            <img src="https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/44.jpg" alt="user">
            <img src="https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/32.jpg" alt="user">
            <img src="https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/46.jpg" alt="user">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-socials">
          <a href="#">Instagram ↗</a>
          <a href="#">Facebook ↗</a>
          <a href="#">Tik Tok ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- ABOUT SECTION -->
    <section class="about-section reveal">
      <div class="section-tag">About EduSmart</div>
      <h2 class="about-text">
        Di EduSmart, kami tidak sekadar belajar — kami mempraktikkannya. Platform kami adalah rumah bagi pelajar dari semua tingkat, dari pemula hingga profesional.
      </h2>
    </section>

    <!-- FEATURES GRID -->
    <section class="features-grid" id="features">
      
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="feature-card dark-card reveal delay-1">
        <div>
          <svg class="icon-top" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
            <line x1="3" y1="9" x2="21" y2="9"></line>
            <line x1="9" y1="21" x2="9" y2="9"></line>
          </svg>
          <h3>Kelas terstruktur secara profesional dengan <span>materi standar industri — belajar dengan nyaman,</span> kapan saja.</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="game-mode-toggle">
          <div class="toggle-icon"></div>
          Focus Mode
        </div>
      </div>

